ed bonus: basic math 45+10, land navigation 36+20 at 4 per level, wilderness survival 30+20, faerie lore is Lore: Faeries & Creatures of Magic 25+10, demon lore is Lore: Demons & Monsters 25+10, dance 30+10. Native Adoran is Language: Native Tongue 98; Gobblely and Dragonese/Elf at 85% are stored flat (judgement: the book prints a figure and no progression). No literacy is printed and none is added. || RELATED: the book prints R.C.C. related and secondary lists; a race played without an O.C.C. uses them, and an occupation''s allowances replace them in a pairing. Four plus one at levels 3, 7, 11 and 15. Holistic Medicine counts as two selections, which the app cannot charge; it is in the note. Secondary: four from the same list without the bonuses. || Swim 40% and climb 60% are natural abilities, kept as prose rather than granted as skills (judgement). || Alignment (any, typically good or selfish), weight 18-28 tons, size 40-60 ft, average level 1D4+1, life span 800 years, habitat and slave market value (4 to 10 million credits) are in the body. No starting money or equipment is printed."
